sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    actor Admin
    participant FE as HROS Web
    participant API as RoleController
    participant Role as RoleModule
    participant Catalog as PermissionCatalog
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Outbox as Outbox

    Admin->>FE: Create Custom Role
    FE->>API: POST Role

    API->>Role: createRole(command)

    Role->>DB: Check tenant role-name uniqueness
    DB-->>Role: Available

    Role->>Catalog: Validate Permission codes
    Catalog-->>Role: Valid

    Role->>Catalog: Validate dependencies
    Catalog-->>Role: Valid

    Role->>DB: BEGIN
    Role->>DB: Insert Role + Role Permissions
    Role->>Outbox: Insert audit/event record
    Role->>DB: COMMIT

    Role-->>API: Created Role
    API-->>FE: 201 Created
